wg-augments-tab = Augments
wg-augments-intro = The cyberware this character starts the round with. Click a part of the body to see what fits there. Bought pieces stay with your character as long as you go into cryo or end the round alive in your own body. Die, get cloned or respawn, and they're gone. Selling one back here returns {$percent}% of its price. Anything fitted during a round only lasts that round. Bought cyberware is worth a lot to the wrong people: cut out of you, it sells like any other loot, and it's no longer yours.
